"Other Charges (" + g("r_waers") + "):" + g("t_v1_kwert"),
"    5)Payment Condition: " + g("t_lv_vtext"),
"    6)Mode of Shipping:" + g("t_lv_airsea"),
"    7)Delivery Period:" + g("t_lv_eindt"),
"    8)Incoterms if any:" + g("r_inco1") + " " + g("r_inco2"),
"    9)E-Payment:Supplier to include Bank details and Account Number in all",
"Invoices",
"",
"    10) Vendor must send one non-negotiable original Master Bill of Lading",
"directly to applicant bank at Lagos, immediately after shipment is done.",
"",
"    11) Bill of Lading/Air Way Bill Number, Commercial Invoice, Packing List, Manufacturer Certificate, CCVO (Combined Certificate for Value &amp; Origin) are mandatory documents as shipping advise to buyer and our Clearing/Logistic Department.",
"",
"L/C (Letter of Credit) Number , Form M Number ( MF &amp; BA numbers ) should appear on every individual shipping documents.",
"",
"All the Bank charges within Nigeria are to Buyer's account &amp; all other bank charges are to supplier's account.",
"",
