"13) Wherever \"Direct Payment\" is involved and \"Form-M is Not valid for Forex\", it is mandatory on the part of supplier to courier one complete set of duly signed and sealed original shipment docs consisting of Airway Bill / Bill of Lading, Commercial Invoice, Packing list, CCVO and Manufacturer Certificate to the Form-M opening Bank and another set to M r. Binod Singh on his address given in Sr. No 12 above. This must be complied with strictly.",
"",
"14) The e-FORM M must be reflected on the Bill of Lading and Cargo Manifest.",
"",
"15) Nigerian destined containerized cargo must be palletized effective with",
"loading from origin from January 1, 2018.",
"",
"",
"",
"Guarantee /Warranty - Unless and until it is clearly specified, as a default, the parts/items covered under this order shall stand Guarantee/Warranty of 18 months from the date of supply or 12 months from the date of installation/commissioning whichever is earlier.",
"",
"Material Safety Data Sheet ( MSDS ) and Operating Manual should be provided wherever applicable.",
""].join("\n");</script></event><ui><textEdit multiLine="1"/></ui><font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/><margin bottomInset="1mm" leftInset="1.5mm" rightInset="1.5mm" topInset="1mm"/></field>
